            "review_title": "Review at Lá Cọ Beach Flamingo",
            "review_text": "Corradini M\nBreda, The Netherlands2 contributions\n0\nDelicious seafood and laid-back vibes\nJan 2025 • Friends\nFresh seafood is an absolute must if you visit Quang Binh, and this place delivers perfectly. The seafood is incredibly fresh, bursting with flavour and served in a relaxed, relaxing space that makes the experience even better. It is a great place to enjoy good food and relax after exploring the area.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Dutch\nShow original\nWritten January 14, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
