            "review_title": "Review at Lá Cọ Beach Flamingo",
            "review_text": "Luong ﻿Thị Nhiên\n3 contributions\n0\nGreat culinary experience\nMay 2024 • Friends\nI really like the clam dish here, because there is no grit in other restaurants. The flavor of clams is fresh and delicious, carefully processed so they retain their natural sweetness and softness. When enjoying, I don't have to worry about biting into grit, which makes the culinary experience that much better.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten June 1, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
