            "review_text": "Văn Hoàng Tươi\n1 contribution\n0\nAccording to my personal feelings, I feel extremely satisfied with this restaurant. Everyone can visit if they have the opportunity.\nMay 2024 • Friends\nThe restaurant I am most satisfied with in Dong Hoi at the present time in terms of service quality, food preparation and price. I stayed in Dong Hoi for 4 days and came here 3 times after trying a few other restaurants. The price is not much different from other shops opposite, while the shop space is extremely clean, the shop staff are agile and take the trouble to observe customers when needed.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten May 28, 2024",
